{
    "m_SGVersion": 0,
    "m_Type": "UnityEditor.ShaderGraph.StickyNoteData",
    "m_ObjectId": "n1000000000000000000000000000001",
    "m_Title": "Decompiled PS 16 / 35",
    "m_Content": "From data.unity3d SlashShaderGraph DXBC.\n\nVoronoi (2021.2 hash, density=Custom1.w 15.88, angle=Custom1.z 1.66)\n* MainTex, then pow(Custom1.x Path 0..3.32)\n* Color * Custom1.y (0.01)\n+ powered.a * Mask.a * vertex.a\nthen Sprite Lit multiplies vertex again.\n\nPath is an exponent, not a wipe.\nRuntime HLSL reads TEXCOORD1.xyzw. This graph packs UV1.xy + Length/Density defaults.",
    "m_TextSize": 0,
    "m_Theme": 0,
    "m_Position": {
        "serializedVersion": "2",
        "x": -80.0,
        "y": -280.0,
        "width": 420.0,
        "height": 220.0
    },
    "m_Group": {
        "m_Id": ""
    }
}

